Berean Standard Bible (BSB)
Public domain as of 2023-04-30 (Berean Bible Translation Committee / Bible Hub).

Official packs (source of truth):
- USFM 3.1: https://bereanbible.com/bsb_usfm.zip
- USJ 3.1: https://bereanbible.com/bsb_usj.zip

Runtime reads vendored USJ book files under vendor/scripture/bsb/usj/*.usj.gz.
USFM book files under vendor/scripture/bsb/usfm/*.usfm.gz are the same text, not parsed on a request.
Book IDs are 3-letter USFM codes (JHN, not Jn). Verse text is never merged into notes.
